<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Micro EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Micro EPS view raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial said research director Russ Crabs raised his fiscal fourth quarter and full year earnings estimates on Sun Microsystems Inc.</p>
<p>-- Raised fourth quarter estimate to $0.59 per share from $0.56.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1997 estimate to $1.87 per share from $1.84.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1998 estimate to $2.26 per share from $2.17.</p>
<p>-- Kept short-term buy and long-term hold ratings.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose one to 38-3/8.</p>
</text>
